1
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,440
That bitch! I'll blow her brains out!

2
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:47,780
I'll kill her, goddamn it! I'm gonna get my hands and kill her!

3
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,320
Shoot, goddamn it!

4
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,540
Hey, Sport.

5
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:02,170
That guy keeps following us. Don't look at him.

6
00:01:18,390 --> 00:01:19,900
Hey, guys.

7
00:01:22,860 --> 00:01:24,690
Wanna take a walk?

8
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:41,090
Loneliness has followed me my whole life, everywhere.

9
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:43,880
In bars, in cars...

10
00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:46,760
sidewalks, stores, everywhere.

11
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,300
There's no escape.

12
00:01:49,970 --> 00:01:52,220
I'm God's lonely man.

13
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:57,340
June 8th.

14
00:01:58,350 --> 00:02:00,810
My life has taken another turn again.

15
00:02:01,070 --> 00:02:04,530
The days move along with regularity, over and over...

16
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:07,280
one day indistinguishable from the next.

17
00:02:07,530 --> 00:02:09,990
A long, continuous chain.

18
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,040
And then suddenly...

19
00:02:12,290 --> 00:02:14,200
there is change.
